		<description><![CDATA[I remember when she lived at the Abode of the Message for a short while, my friend and I would drive her to the doctor&#039;s office occasionally. Such a sweet soul, delicate. The fragrance of her essence was always with her, and always brightened the drive. I don&#039;t have much more to say other then it was truly a blessing to have known her.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I remember when she lived at the Abode of the Message for a short while, my friend and I would drive her to the doctor&#8217;s office occasionally. Such a sweet soul, delicate. The fragrance of her essence was always with her, and always brightened the drive. I don&#8217;t have much more to say other then it was truly a blessing to have known her.</p>
